      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">together with whatever is realized from the price of the <del>cinnabar </del>cinnabar (zinjafr), and buy for your servant with the proceeds two fills of</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">good loose musk and some pod musk. With the remainder, buy whatever your auspicious judgment sees fit: bleached cloth,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">long unbleached cloth, or whatever God grants success in. This I leave to your good fortune and success, may God decree your well-being.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">The purse of silver bears your excellency&rsquo;s name and mine. It comes via the elder Barak\u0101t al-\u1e24alab\u012b. Farewell.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
